Third-party source acknowledgements
-----------------------------------

### JobRadar (GPL-3.0): no code remains

Earlier versions adapted job-source adapters from https://github.com/jason-huanghao/jobradar (GPL-3.0).
On 2026-10-21 `search/bundesagentur.py`, `search/indeed.py`, `search/stepstone.py`, `search/xing.py` and
`search/jsonld.py` were rewritten from the public API and schema descriptions (bundesAPI Jobsuche
description, JobSpy documentation, schema.org JobPosting) without that code. No JobRadar code is part of
the program any more.

