management, ATS URL detection, document text extraction, and later German
ATS field-fill patterns (Personio / SmartRecruiters / SuccessFactors) are
adapted from:

  https://github.com/AbhishekMandapmalvi/AutoApply
  Copyright (C) 2026 Abhishek Mandapmalvi
  Licensed under the MIT License

The MIT License permission notice and copyright must be retained for those
portions. Electron/Flask frontend code from AutoApply is not included.

Auto-Fill-Forms (https://github.com/w4seemdev/Auto-Fill-Forms) was inspected
for ATS coverage ideas only; no code or playbook text was copied (no license).
OpenResume and pyresparser were evaluated and not vendored.

