### Free calendar protocol libraries

The runtime uses python-caldav (GPL-3.0-or-later OR Apache-2.0), icalendar
(BSD-2-Clause), and recurring-ical-events (LGPL-3.0-or-later) as unmodified
installed dependencies. They provide CalDAV transport and RFC 5545 recurrence
expansion; no source is vendored by this change.

  https://github.com/python-caldav/caldav
  https://github.com/collective/icalendar
  https://github.com/niccokunzmann/python-recurring-ical-events
